    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mazzy is a pixel-style casual puzzle game built around a simple but interesting idea: rotate and reshape the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you play as a stickman navigating strange mazes. Your goal is quite simple\u2014reach the goal. However, in this world, the path is not always straightforward. You will be blocked when you try to find the correct path. By switching to Edit Mode, you can rotate the entire sections, shifting platforms, unlocking new perspectives, and revealing the new paths that weren\u2019t noticed before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors may block your way \u2014 or become part of the solution. You'll need to rotate with purpose, think spatially, and find clever ways to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mazzy offers a relaxing and engaging experience. Rotate the level. Collect the items. Reach the goal. It\u2019s that simple \u2014 and that fun.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mazzy is a pixel-style casual puzzle game built around a simple but interesting idea: rotate and reshape the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you play as a stickman navigating strange mazes. Your goal is quite simple\u2014reach the goal. However, in this world, the path is not always straightforward. You will be blocked when you try to find the correct path. By switching to Edit Mode, you can rotate the entire sections, shifting platforms, unlocking new perspectives, and revealing the new paths that weren\u2019t noticed before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors may block your way \u2014 or become part of the solution. You'll need to rotate with purpose, think spatially, and find clever ways to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mazzy offers a relaxing and engaging experience. Rotate the level. Collect the items. Reach the goal. It\u2019s that simple \u2014 and that fun.</p>",
    "short_description": "Mazzy is a pixel-style casual puzzle game built around the core concept of rotating the level. Rotate the level, collect the items, and reshape the maze to reach the goal. Simple and fun.",
